{
  "page_id": "BR-13",
  "section_header": "BRAKE SYSTEM — Brake Booster",
  "title": null,
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 1,
      "description": "Cross-sectional view of master cylinder with SST (Special Service Tool) positioned on top with gasket below",
      "labels": [
        "SST",
        "Gasket"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 5,
        "left": 1,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 30
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Set SST on the master cylinder, and lower the pin until its tip slightly touches the piston."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09737-00010",
      "description": null
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "text": "NOTE: Take the measurement with the gasket in place."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Cross-sectional view showing SST inverted and positioned on the brake booster",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 34,
        "left": 1,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 30
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(b) Turn SST upside down, and set it on the booster."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09737-00010",
      "description": null
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(c) Check that push rod lightly touches the pin head."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Illustration showing hands adjusting the booster push rod",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 63,
        "left": 1,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 30
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(d) Adjust the booster push rod length until the push rod lightly touches the pin head."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "2. INSTALL BRAKE BOOSTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Install the brake booster over the gasket.",
        "(b) Tighten the four nuts."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Brake booster mounting nuts",
      "value": "130 kg-cm (9 ft-lb, 13 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 4,
      "description": "Illustration showing brake booster installation with four mounting nuts visible",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 92,
        "left": 1,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "3. CONNECT CLEVIS TO BRAKE PEDAL"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Install the clevis pin and clip."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "4. INSTALL MASTER CYLINDER"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(See steps 1, 2 and 4 on page BR-11)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "5. CONNECT HOSE TO BRAKE BOOSTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 5,
      "description": "Illustration showing hose connection to brake booster with hands performing the connection",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 115,
